---
import SubPage from '../layouts/SubPage.astro';
import { appRegisterUrl } from '../lib/app';

const title = "FAQs | OBII";
const description = "Understand exactly what OBII does, what is free on ausbiz, what your membership includes and how the seven-day trial works.";
---

<SubPage title={title} description={description}>
	<section slot="hero" class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow light">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</div>
	<h1>Your questions. <em>Clear answers.</em></h1><p class="lede">Understand exactly what OBII does, what is free on ausbiz, what your membership includes and how the seven-day trial works.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href={appRegisterUrl}>Try OBII free for 7 days <span>→</span></a><a class="btn ghost" href="/">Explore OBII</a></div>
	<p class="promise">7 days free · No credit card required · Your choice to subscribe</p><div class="mini-proof"><span>Real expert perspectives</span><span>Original sources</span><span>Your decision</span></div>
	</div>
	<div class="hero-art"><div class="panel"><div class="panelhead"><span class="chip">COMMON QUESTIONS</span><span class="tiny">Clear answers</span></div>
	<div class="sourcecard"><div><strong>What am I actually buying?</strong><p>Source-linked investment research and tools, not another TV channel.</p></div>
	</div>
	<div class="sourcecard" style="margin-top:9px"><div><strong>Can I try OBII first?</strong><p>Yes. Seven days free, no card to start.</p></div>
	</div>
	<div class="sourcecard" style="margin-top:9px"><div><strong>Does OBII make decisions for me?</strong><p>No. The judgement stays with you.</p></div>
	</div>
	</div>
	</div>
	</div>
	</section>
	<main><section class="section alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">THE ESSENTIALS</div>
	<h2>Everything you should know before you start.</h2><p>No jargon, no hidden benefit. Understand the research, the difference from free ausbiz and your options.</p></div>
	<div class="faq-layout"><div class="faq-list"><details open><summary>What exactly is OBII?</summary><p>OBII is a paid investment research membership built around real named expert commentary. It helps self-directed investors find views on the shares they follow, explore the available reasoning and check the original dated sources.</p></details>
	<details ><summary>What makes OBII different from watching ausbiz for free?</summary><p>ausbiz is where you watch or hear the original expert interviews for free. OBII is where you research the record: search relevant perspectives, use watchlists and follow experts, with source links back to the original material.</p></details>
	<details ><summary>What do you mean by investment intelligence?</summary><p>Technology helps organise and search expert commentary around the shares and people you follow. Real market professionals supply the views; OBII helps you research them. You remain responsible for your own decisions.</p></details>
	<details ><summary>Why would I come back every few days?</summary><p>New market commentary continues to appear. Return to the companies and experts you follow to research fresh perspectives and check the original sources where available.</p></details>
	<details ><summary>Can I try the product before subscribing?</summary><p>Yes. The public offer is a seven-day trial with no credit card required to start. After exploring OBII, you can decide whether to choose a paid membership.</p></details>
	<details ><summary>How much is Standard or Pro?</summary><p>Standard is A$49 per month and Pro is A$149 per month. GST is added at checkout. See Pricing for the full feature comparison.</p></details>
	<details ><summary>What happens when the seven days end?</summary><p>The published no-card trial lets you explore before choosing a paid plan. If you want to keep access, choose Standard or Pro and review the billing details before confirming your subscription.</p></details>
	<details ><summary>Can I cancel my subscription?</summary><p>The published service FAQ says members can cancel through their account at any time. Review the current subscription terms at checkout for the details that apply to your plan.</p></details>
	<details ><summary>Is OBII personalised financial advice?</summary><p>No. It is a tool for researching general market information and original expert commentary. It does not make individual investment decisions for you or guarantee investment outcomes.</p></details>
	<details ><summary>Can I verify what an expert really said?</summary><p>That is central to the proposition. Available views should be attributable to real named experts and original dated interviews, so you can check the underlying source for yourself.</p></details>
	</div>
	<aside class="faq-aside"><div class="eyebrow">TRY FIRST</div>
	<h3>Seven days to explore OBII.</h3><p>No credit card required. Follow a company or expert, explore source-linked commentary and decide whether you want to keep going.</p><a class="btn" href={appRegisterUrl} style="width:100%;font-size:12px">Try OBII free →</a><p style="margin-top:19px"><a style="color:#5b50e0;font-weight:750" href="/pricing">Compare Standard and Pro →</a></p></aside></div>
	</div>
	</section>
	<section class="section small"><div class="wrap"><div class="cta-panel"><div><h2>Still curious? Start with a share you follow.</h2><p>Start with a company you follow. Explore the expert thinking and original sources before choosing a paid plan.</p></div>
	<a class="btn" href={appRegisterUrl}>Try OBII free for 7 days →</a></div>
	</div>
	</section>
	</main>
</SubPage>
